  "properties": {
    "title": "Organization of the local/regional OSGEO Chapter",
    "description": "\"When I started my journey organizing FOSS4G in Mostar, I set one clear goal: to ignite the formation of a regional OSGeo Chapter. FOSS4G Mostar is not the result \u2013 it\u2019s just the beginning. Join me on this quest.\"\r\n\r\nLet's plant seeds for lasting collaboration. Let\u2019s make the open geospatial movement stronger and more connected.\r\n\r\nPerson to contact: Marko Puljic marko.puljic(at)ecoplan(dot)ba\r\n\r\nhttps://wiki.osgeo.org/wiki/FOSS4G-Europe-2025/BirdsOfAFeather#Organization_of_the_local.2Fregional_OSGEO_Chapter",
